<title>JAMAICA: SOCCER-JAMAICA BEAT HONDURAS 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-JAMAICA BEAT HONDURAS 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTON 1996-09-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jamaica beat Honduras 3-0</p>
<p>(halftime 2-0) in a CONCACAF semifinal stage group three World</p>
<p>Cup qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers - Walter Boyd (15th and 51st minutes), Theodore</p>
<p>Whitmore (41st).</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, goals against, points)</p>
<p> Jamaica	     1  1  0  0  3  0  3</p>
<p> Mexico		1  1  0  0  3  0  3</p>
<p> Honduras	    1  0  0  1  0  3  0</p>
<p> St. Vincent	 1  0  0  1  0  3  0</p>
<p>Top two teams go through to the final qualifying round.</p>
</text>
